From 9ab6123da21a8481623f4e43fa5c4288cc4f08a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shuko-apply <apply@shuko.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:50:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] unit C-1-ai: edits

Remove the references to the built-in AI - chat, inline chat, language models, tools, MCP, agent host, Agents window, AI search results - from the remaining files. The chat, lm and AI members of the extension API do nothing, see extHostRemovedApi.ai.ts. The chat entitlement service never asks for Copilot entitlements, see NullChatEntitlementService at the end of chatEntitlementService.ts. The removed API shapes and ids are dropped from extHost.protocol.ts. The packaging no longer ships the Copilot runtime, the Copilot CLI launcher or the agent host crypto bundle, requests to open the Agents window open nothing, and the About dialog no longer lists Copilot versions.
